' Notes
' ============================================
note right of UC_AdminDashboard
  Admin Dashboard displays:
  - Real-time system statistics
  - Critical alerts
  - Pending approvals
  - Low stock warnings
  - Emergency requests
  - Recent activities
end note

note bottom of UC_ManageUsers
  User Management includes:
  - Create/Update/Delete users
  - Assign/Remove roles
  - Activate/Deactivate accounts
  - Reset passwords
  - View activity logs
end note

note left of UC_ReportsDashboard
  Comprehensive reporting system:
  - Donor analytics
  - Donation trends
  - Inventory insights
  - Request fulfillment metrics
  - Custom report builder
  - Scheduled reports
  - Multiple export formats
end note

note bottom of UC_SystemSettings
  System Configuration:
  - Blood type thresholds
  - Notification rules
  - Eligibility criteria
  - Email templates
  - Backup settings
  - Security policies
end note

note right of UC_AuditLogs
  Audit & Security features:
  - Track all user actions
  - Monitor login attempts
  - Review data changes
  - Export audit reports
  - Configure security policies
  - Compliance reporting
end note

